#
# The store is a flat document keyspace (ADR-0017 d1/d15). Markdown documents that
# live here (e.g. the M Manual SP0004-M-gateway-bringup.md) keep CRLF per the repo
# doc convention. Scoped to *.md so CRLF never touches the packaged and generated
# artifacts (.zip, gerbers, drill, PNG), which are binary. Since ADR-0017 d19 the
# KiCad sources are inside -S-src.zip / -D-src.zip and no loose .kicad_* object
# remains; a file extracted from a package for editing is working state, not a
# tracked object, and needs no attribute either.
*.md text eol=crlf
